    "title": "Senior Forward Deployed Google Workspace Engineer (m/f/d)",
    "company_name": "Zoi",
    "company_logo": null,
    "description": "YOUR BRILLIANT FUTURE IN TECH IS NOW&nbsp; Welcome to the world of Zoi! We transform manufacturing and retail enterprises through AI-first strategies that deliver measurable business value. We don't just advise: we implement, operate, and scale solutions that turn AI adoption into competitive advantage. We are expanding our European teams in Stuttgart, Berlin, Cologne and Lisbon . We are also looking for support at our international locations in Guadalajara and Mexico City. Just choose your favorite Zoi city! Travel between our locations is possible. WHAT YOU DO Drive, guide and consult Google Workspace customers and help technically in migrations from start to finish, transitioning clients smoothly from Microsoft 365 to Google Workspace or other platform environments. Serve as the technical backbone in client engagement, combining hands-on technical execution with clear, impactful stakeholder communication. Architect and implement Google Workspace integration across diverse, international enterprise clients. Integrate Google Workspace with external enterprise systems and third-party tools to optimize business workflows. Support large-scale data migrations, ensuring high integrity, minimum downtime, and zero loss of mission-critical data. WHO YOU ARE Google Workspace Expert: You leverage your hands-on experience in Google Workspace to provide strategic consulting and tailored guidance to our customers. Tech-Heavy &amp; Client-Facing: Strong technical skills matched with clear, articulate customer communication ability. Tool &amp; Integration Savvy: Familiarity with typical state of the art enterprise IT environments (EntraID, Sharepoint Online, Exchange Online, Intune), data migration tools and third-party tools/ISVs is a big plus. Certified Professional: Holding Google Workspace &amp; Digital Leader certifications is highly valued. Fluent Communicator: Language requirements vary by region to support Europe: Fluency in German and English Mexico &amp; Guadalajara City: Fluency in Spanish and English Do you like to be surrounded by brilliant minds? Awesome. At Zoi, you become part of our community of tech enthusiasts and develop your full potential. Create fresh ideas and shape the digital transformation of our enterprise customers sustainably. GOOD WORK SHOULD BE REWARDED , which is why we offer various bonus models at our company TIME IS WISDOM , 20 % of your working time is available for experimenting and education SKILL YOURSELF UP, &nbsp;Zoi can only be as good as you are. That’s why we value constant training and development BE FREE thanks to our absolutely flexible working hours and work remotely from any of our locations LEVERAGE AI POWER with access to cutting-edge AI technologies, to automate tasks, gain insights, and innovate DEVELOP YOURSELF with our individual certification and training plan FAMILY COMES FIRST , rely on our financial support for childcare REFUEL at our regular free Friday lunch Zoi is an equal opportunity employer, we're committed to helping you do your best work. Our promise is to champion diversity, build an inclusive culture and do our part to create a more equitable professional landscape. Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow",
