    "title": "International Business Analytics Internship (H/F)",
    "company_name": "Teampicnic",
    "company_logo": null,
    "description": "&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;As a Business Analytics Intern at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of international innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This dual-location role is all about driving impact. You&#39;ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that redefine the grocery shopping experience across Europe. Throughout this year-long program, you’ll exchange between two locations &lt;strong&gt;Paris (6 months) &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam (6 months)&lt;/strong&gt;, gaining cross-market perspectives in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status-quo. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;You are currently pursuing a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s&lt;/strong&gt; in a Quantitative field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;SQL and Python&lt;/strong&gt; or similar programming languages&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You are able to hold fluent presentations both in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;French&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have an&lt;strong&gt; EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You are available for &lt;strong&gt;12 months&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Depending on your Internship performance, we can discuss further opportunities for a full-time role at Picnic!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💪Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧑‍🎓Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome scaleup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎓Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer a gross salary of €1,500 per month in Paris and €800 per month in Amsterdam for a full-time internship.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note&lt;/strong&gt;: You will need to &lt;strong&gt;secure your own housing&lt;/strong&gt; in both Amsterdam and Paris, though our team is happy to share local tips and guidance to help with your search!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow",
