    "title": "Key Account Manager Danish Market Native Speaker Copenhagen",
    "company_name": "Packmatic GmbH",
    "company_logo": "",
    "description": "Packmatic is the leading digital platform for packaging procurement. We connect companies with a Europe-wide network of packaging suppliers â fast, transparent and data-driven. With Packa , we have built a new all-in-one solution for intelligent packaging management: companies run their packaging 100% digitally, cut packaging costs and meet sustainability requirements such as PPWR or EUDR without the usual headache. Together, we are changing how packaging is designed, sourced and managed â for more efficiency, more sustainability and more impact. Backed by strong investors and driven by an ambitious team, we are growing fast â and we are looking for people who want to shape that growth with us. \\n What you can expect at Packmatic Ownership. You run your market independently, backed by a highly motivated team that has your back â wherever you work from. Impact. A role that visibly shapes Packmatic's international growth. Creative freedom. You work directly with the founding team and have the freedom to build your own playbook from day one. Flexibility. 100% remote, combined with customer visits across Denmark and the Nordics. Leadership. An inspiring vision, experienced serial founders at the helm and leading investors behind us. Recognition and commitment. We believe in fair pay, and you get a clear path to grow and develop with us. Your tasks You are our visionary. You build our business in Denmark â from first contact to signed contract. You work hand in hand with our SDRs, keep finding new ways to create pipeline and share what works with the team. You are our hunter. You go after new customers proactively and consistently, and you present our platform to every stakeholder â from procurement and technology through to top management. You are our networker. You steer complex buying processes and manage stakeholders across departments with a sure touch. You are the driving force behind every deal. You work closely with the German team on demos, technical questions and proposals. You are our ambassador. You are the face of Packmatic in the Danish market and hold your own with buyers and senior management alike. You are our sales driver. You own an annual target of EUR 3â4 million in new packaging revenue. By growing your accounts strategically, you spot and convert up- and cross-selling potential â and make a visible contribution to our growth. What you bring You are a sales professional. You have at least 5 years of experience in technical B2B sales, ideally in SaaS or an industrial environment. You are our market expert. You know the Danish market inside out, you are based in or around Copenhagen, and you build lasting customer relationships â culturally on point and close to your customers. You are a doer. You work independently, take decisions and get things done without waiting to be asked. You are a navigator. You think in a structured way, find your way through complex setups and move confidently across every decision-making level. You are a communication specialist. You are a native Danish speaker and fluent in English. You are a road warrior. You are flexible, happy to travel and work closely with our Berlin team (on site roughly every 8 weeks). \\n Please mention the word **GEMS** and tag RNDcuMTEuMy44OQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNDcuMTEuMy44OQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
