    "description": "Build What's Next With Us At SEAhub Asia, your career isn't just a job â it's a launchpad. We move fast, think big, and build futures together. What's waiting for you here? Remote-first roles built for freedom and flexibility Learning &amp; Development That Sharpens Skills And Accelerates Careers Competitive salary packages for high performers Wellbeing perks that help you thrive inside and outside work A team that supports, celebrates, and wins as one and we're just getting started. We're growing across Southeast Asia â and we're searching for sharp minds, big thinkers and curious hearts ready to help us build what's next. learners, and big thinkers who want to create what's next. If you're ready to make a real impact and grow with a future-ready team, your next chapter starts here. Job Summary Support the Data Analytics team by assisting with data validation, report generation, and basic analysis to help ensure data accuracy and enable informed business decision-making. Responsibilities: Reporting, Analysis &amp; Insight Communication Prepare reports and perform data analysis to support data-driven decision-making Monitor key business performance metrics to identify trends, patterns, and anomalies Assist in building and maintaining dashboards and reports for performance tracking Communicate data insights to stakeholders in a clear, concise, and actionable way Data Quality &amp; Validation Support the validation and upkeep of data accuracy across dashboards and data pipelines Cross-Team Collaboration Respond to data requests from cross-functional teams, including coordinating requirements and providing basic analytical support Process Improvement &amp; Documentation Document data processes and workflows, and contribute to improving existing data practices and standards Explore and apply new tools and methods to enhance the efficiency and quality of data work Ad-Hoc Analytical Projects Assist with ad-hoc data tasks and analytical projects as needed Requirements: 0â1 year of experience in data analysis or a related field. Foundational knowledge of SQL, Excel, and data visualization platforms such as Power BI or Tableau. Exposure to Python for data analysis is an added advantage. Highly detail-oriented with a strong focus on maintaining data quality and accuracy. Strong communication skills with the ability to present findings and insights clearly. Demonstrates a proactive mindset and willingness to learn new tools, technologies, and analytical techniques. Well-organized, with the ability to prioritize and manage multiple tasks effectively. Don't miss out on this exciting opportunity! Apply now at www.seahubasia.com. Please mention the word **BRIGHTEST** and tag RNDcuMTEuMy44OQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNDcuMTEuMy44OQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
